//
// KEY REQUIREMENTS (ENFORCED):
// ✅ Embed *BaseIntent
// ✅ Use typed state enum (not raw string)
// ✅ Flatten state (no wrapped model)
// ✅ Implement ScreenResultHandler interface
// ✅ Use i.getContext() not context.Background()
// ✅ Use behaviors.RenderModalOverlay() for modals
